OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Frain or showers, but becoming drier
OL,7,Fand clearer across Eilean Siar and
OL,8,Fnorth Highland. Breezy with the
OL,9,Fsouthwest winds strong at times across
OL,10,Fthe northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FRain possible at first
OL,13,Fthrough Lochaber and Speyside, but
OL,14,Fmainly bright with occasional sunny
OL,15,Fspells and a scattering of showers.
OL,16,FThe east may see further rain in the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
